Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: MeeVPN - OpenVPN client app for the Nokia N9
 Connect and disconnect with one tap, .ovpn profiles from MyDocs/openvpn,
 user name and password login (auth-user-pass), optional DNS from the VPN
 server, connection details and log. Uses OpenVPN 2.5 from openvpn-n9.
 Designed and written by Claude (Anthropic) together with smyhu.
